{"id":"wb-4-111","name":"扎塘寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"扎塘寺","text":"扎塘寺（藏语：གྲ་ཐང་དགོན，威利转写：gra thang dgon，THL：Dratang Gön）是位于中国西藏自治区山南市扎囊县扎塘镇的一座藏传佛教萨迦派寺院。该寺原是扎巴恩协创立的扎巴派的祖寺。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%89%8E%E5%A1%98%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":93289293,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93289293","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9abaa2f6b19acb6d97c80442.jpg","title":"Manjushri_and_Maitreya_mural,_Drathang_Monastery.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Manjushri_and_Maitreya_mural,_Drathang_Monastery.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/Manjushri_and_Maitreya_mural%2C_Drathang_Monastery.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"未知Unknown author","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"Drathang Monastery Murals, Tibet","width":320,"height":263}}